Subject: [PATCH 12/12] E4: GPU fractional sumcheck equality test; log blowup
 override in the profile

tests/e4_gpu_frac.rs: proof, point and transcript state of fractional_sumcheck equal
on the GPU and the CPU at 2^12, 2^13 and 2^17 leaves. e4_profile takes E4_LOG_BLOWUP
= 2 or 1 (queries 120/85/82 or 196/89/82, the D3 sets of M7 RESULTS 2b.2) for the
owner options of E4.
